.TH "PERCH-ALIAS-REMOVE" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-alias\-remove \- remove an alias or catch\-all
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch alias remove [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Remove an alias address or catch\-all from the address table. Messages already delivered are unaffected.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-address <value>
alias address
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch alias remove \-\-address sales@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-alias\fR(1)
